## Protocolo operacional

### Fluxo de autenticacao (end-to-end)

```
[Browser]
  |-- GET /login
  |     |-- (auth)/login/page.tsx (formulario)
  |     |-- signIn("credentials", { email, password })
  |           |
  |           v
  |     NextAuth route handler
  |           |-- POST /auth/login (NestJS)
  |           |     |-- AuthService.login(email, password)
  |           |     |-- retorna { user, token }
  |           |
  |           |-- JWT callback: inclui userId, role, tenantId
  |           |-- Session callback: expoe user.id, user.role, user.tenantId
  |
  |-- GET /dashboard (autenticado)
        |-- auth() -> sessao NextAuth (server-side)
        |-- getTenantFromRequest() -> resolve tenant por slug/subdominio
        |-- apiServer("/dashboard/stats")
              |-- headers: x-api-key, x-user-id, x-tenant-id
              |-- AppAuthGuard valida:
              |     1. @Public()? -> permite
              |     2. x-api-key match? -> busca user no Prisma -> valida tenant
              |     3. Bearer JWT? -> verifica token -> extrai tenant
              |-- req.user = { userId, role, tenantId }
```

